title: "JEPX-EPF-Benchmark: Probabilistic 48-Step Electricity Price Forecasting Dataset and Code for the Japan Electric Power Exchange"
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the Applied Energy paper (preferred-citation) and this repository / Zenodo deposit."
type: software
